            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Accessibility access</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Grant Access now takes you straight to Accessibility in System Settings, without a second "would like to control this Mac" dialog on top of it. macOS's own prompt appears only the first time WindowSmith asks.</li>
  <li>The menu's permission card has one button, Grant Access, in place of two that did the same thing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
